# Data model

Target shape (not fully implemented yet): `book.json` as book → spreads → pages → slots → assets.

- Validate boundaries with Zod when introducing book/EXIF I/O.
- Prefer immutable updates and serializable plain objects for persisted state.
- Do not invent parallel schemas without an OpenSpec change.
